WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:05.340
A new park has opened. Two friends give their opinions.

2
00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:08.070
Co sądzisz o nowym parku?

3
00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:11.840
Moim zdaniem jest piękny, ale za mały.

4
00:00:12.490 --> 00:00:15.130
Zgadzam się. Brakuje ławek.

5
00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:20.000
Moim zdaniem to dobry pomysł.

6
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:25.480
Start with in my opinion, or I think that.

7
00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:30.630
To disagree politely, say you do not completely agree.

8
00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:36.110
You agree with your friend. What do you say?

9
00:00:38.610 --> 00:00:40.210
Zgadzam się z tobą.

10
00:00:41.010 --> 00:00:44.570
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

11
00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:47.970
Zgadzam się z tobą.

12
00:00:49.970 --> 00:00:54.370
Paweł gives his opinion about the park. What does he say?

13
00:00:56.870 --> 00:00:59.990
Moim zdaniem jest piękny, ale za mały.

14
00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:04.350
Did you say it? Say it once more, out loud.

15
00:01:06.150 --> 00:01:09.270
Moim zdaniem jest piękny, ale za mały.

16
00:01:11.270 --> 00:01:14.830
